  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research Secondment and Academic Advisory Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme provides funding and a mechanism to increase access to academic expertise on FCDO&apos;s priorities. It will likely include long-term academic secondments into FCDO and establishing a network of academics that work with the department on medium- and short-term commissions.</narrative>
  </description>
